 PS §4.1's one order (A.2); the slow half is a feeder of THE SHARED PRESENCE COMPOSER (A.3); the draw is taken before the opener's gates (PR-V1); the campaign count never falls below the peace count (PR-r2-3); harassment triggers on the fork (PR-V3); ONE place per rider a week (the carry). No STOP. First attacked by `skeptic/PR-r2.md` (4 B · 15 M · 10 m) with the SEAMS-r2 and HOST-r2 rows routed here; every id and every RULINGS-ROUND2b item for PR is disposed (§20; `cure/D-PR-r2.md`). The chair's three STOP rulings are applied (§17). ONE persisted shape (`spatialLedgers.patrols`, four keyed maps, §2.7), taken by delegation on the owner's own request, plus ONE conditional stamp on the landed deployment record (§2.7). No STOP stands: SEAMS-r2-9 (one body of men) is cured on PR's side in agreement with ST's round-2b OD-ST-39, and its alternative is recorded for the chair (§17, OD-PR-41). Every constant is DRAFT and UNMEASURED on the FP-46 roster.
